<ac:structured-macro ac:name="info" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:rich-text-body><p>The info macro is blue, which is what GitHub draws NOTE in.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name="tip" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:rich-text-body><p>The tip macro is green, which is TIP.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name="note" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:rich-text-body><p>The note macro is yellow -- not purple -- so it is WARNING, not IMPORTANT.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name="warning" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:rich-text-body><p>The warning macro is red, so it is CAUTION.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name="info" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:rich-text-body><p>A multi-block callout: the blank quoted line between blocks has no trailing space.</p><ul><li>alpha</li><li>beta</li></ul></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
